{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod","id":944601,"title":"Pokemon GO NWOD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-05T17:17:52-07:00","id":944601,"title":"Pokemon GO NWOD","content":"So how would you make a device that would let any splat use a pokeball? And what suggestions do you have for a magical PokeStop in the setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T17:23:01-07:00","id":944606,"title":"","content":"I imagine one of the funniest places for a Pokestop or Gym would be wherever leaders of a splat would meet up. A Werewolf Tribe meeting place, Vampire council, Mage Consilia. Bonus points on the Gym if the Hierarch or Prince actually plays too and owns it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T17:28:21-07:00","id":944609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bwgustaf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod#post944601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So how would you make a device that would let any splat use a pokeball?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't understand. Is there something preventing splats from just doing it with a smartphone like anyone else?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bwgustaf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod#post944601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And what suggestions do you have for a magical PokeStop in the setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>I could totally see a vampire Prince declaring Elysium at a pokestop. Or a werewolf pack turning a pokestop into a Locus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T17:49:52-07:00","id":944617,"title":"","content":"Wasn't this basically the plot of one of the Shin Megami Tensei games, with the demonic phone app?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T18:01:36-07:00","id":944624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod?p=944617#post944617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't this basically the plot of one of the Shin Megami Tensei games, with the demonic phone app?</div> </div> </div> </div>Particularly the first, yeah, though they've revisited it a lot.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Erm, on a more useful angle, I think it sort of depends on exactly what you mean by Pokemon Go NWOD. Is this people in the NWOD playing Pokemon Go, a World of Darkness/Pokemon Go crossover where there actual monsters running around, or a World of Darkness take on augmented reality gaming? I know it's kind of a dumb response, but each is going to produce really different results. EVERYONE is going to use it for social manipulation, but is &quot;just&quot; limited to changing the flow of foot traffic, or more heavily customized to push the ideological agendas of the setting's supernatural puppet masters?<br /> <br /> On a side note, if Pokemon were real in a nWoD setting, how would major templates interact with pokemon types? Do dead Gengar produce ghosts? Can living Gengar become Awakened, or be Embraced? Is Mewtwo a Promethean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10825,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10825-crosswords","user":"Crosswords","date":".  Felt like it wasn't a useful comment yet. 08-05-2016, 10:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10825-crosswords","name":"Crosswords","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T18:50:28-07:00","id":944644,"title":"","content":"Vampires using it as a lure","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T19:14:24-07:00","id":944654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crosswords</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod?p=944624#post944624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Particularly the first, yeah, though they've revisited it a lot.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Erm, on a more useful angle, I think it sort of depends on exactly what you mean by Pokemon Go NWOD. Is this people in the NWOD playing Pokemon Go, a World of Darkness/Pokemon Go crossover where there actual monsters running around, or a World of Darkness take on augmented reality gaming? I know it's kind of a dumb response, but each is going to produce really different results. EVERYONE is going to use it for social manipulation, but is &quot;just&quot; limited to changing the flow of foot traffic, or more heavily customized to push the ideological agendas of the setting's supernatural puppet masters?<br /> <br /> On a side note, if Pokemon were real in a nWoD setting, how would major templates interact with pokemon types? Do dead Gengar produce ghosts? Can living Gengar become Awakened, or be Embraced? Is Mewtwo a Promethean?</div> </div> </div> </div>Real Pokemon fighting Real supernatural Groups. The App connects the world of darkness to the world of pokemon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T19:31:53-07:00","id":944664,"title":"","content":"Team Rocket would be getting cozy with the Chiron Group. Sin Eaters would be the gym leaders at every gym near a graveyard, funeral home or morgue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T21:22:16-07:00","id":944684,"title":"","content":"My immediate thought upon reading the title is people playing Pokemon GO and wandering into supernatural locations while not paying attention.<br /> Wait, I'm having an idea storm<br /> <br /> The God-Machine employs Infrastructure that relies on luring people in with Pokemon, then infecting their phone with some sort of nefarious program. Said program may, or may not, be MissingNo.<br /> Werewolves have been finding hostile Spirits appearing in the Shadow, apparently in response to the popularity of Pokemon GO. They initially seem benign, but eventually prove much more prone to becoming Magath than regular Spirits.<br /> Pokemon GO apparently still works in the Hedge, but the Pokemon found there aren't like those found by people in the mundane world-... And they are always hungry.<br /> Mages don't need phones to find Pokemon, they occasionally appear under Mage Sight. They don't seem to be any different than any other type of symbol, but their mere presence everywhere is odd.<br /> <br /> This is exceedingly silly. I love it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T01:53:15-07:00","id":944759,"title":"","content":"Network 0 are going to go crazy with that app- putting lures in places where supernaturals meet in order to expose them, using the color and ruling pokemon of a nearby gym in order to send messages to other members, spreading rumors about rare pokemon to force mass gatherings of people...<br /> <br /> yeah, this is going to be fun","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T08:28:24-07:00","id":944860,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/426867-gotta-catch-em-all\">Here </a>is an old thread about Pokemon and changeling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T11:21:13-07:00","id":944957,"title":"","content":"I can see the game (or something similar) playing into a Promethean Chronicle, as the Throng immerses themselves into the new hot thing to have a pretext for interaction with humans and to be wandering around at random places. <br /> <br /> I also like the idea of an emotional scene where the Throng finds themselves stumbling upon a crowd of players gathering around a Pokestop/Lure/Gym/Whatever and, after a short period of initial suspicion, are quickly accepted as a part of the group despite being strangers, possibly earning a Milestone. I can also see the Teams providing a opportunity to learn of humanity's tendency to embrace the group as a way to define their own identity (like with sports teams), friendly competition, and humanity's ability to joke around and feign hostility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:41:56-07:00","id":945837,"title":"","content":"I now imagine Mages using Pokemon Go (with abit of Forces Magic mixed in) as a viable way to do the Duel Arcane. :3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:52:47-07:00","id":945851,"title":"","content":"More people acting like hunters? Most Pure would think it great. Some Predator Kings might think it laughable, what with the lack of danger danger, but they're still participating in the hunt. Would be a great time for them to reach out. I'm sure some Ivory Claws conglomerate would buy it out, try to figure some way to make it more addicting, have it act as a sort of 'gateway' to real hunting. Call in the Fire-Touched to try and get some spiritual support.<br /> <br /> Hunting and competition spirits popping up more frequently.<br /> <br /> Somewhere there's an ancient Firstborn ready to waken. The world wasn't ready for it yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-07-2016, 10:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T07:34:38-07:00","id":946155,"title":"","content":"Free Council in London starts using Fate and Forces magic to get people using the app to go on Runewalks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1965-joebobjoe","name":"joebobjoe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T11:34:26-07:00","id":946321,"title":"","content":"Considering the fact that animism is a big real-life influence in the creation of Pok\u00e9mon, what if the app/game reveals the locations of spirits that already exist in Twilight, projecting the image of certain Pok\u00e9mon to denote what kind of spirit is actually there?<br /> <br /> Could be big for werewolves, mages and hunters alike!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:35:07-07:00","id":946463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944601-pokemon-go-nwod?p=946321#post946321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering the fact that animism is a big real-life influence in the creation of Pok\u00e9mon, what if the app/game reveals the locations of spirits that already exist in Twilight, projecting the image of certain Pok\u00e9mon to denote what kind of spirit is actually there?<br /> <br /> Could be big for werewolves, mages and hunters alike!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What if the same application gets turned into a supernatural device to capture said spirits as if they were Pokemon? I mean, how would a normal person know whether their Pokemon battle was merely in game code, or actually taking place in Twilight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T15:01:37-07:00","id":946490,"title":"","content":"Someone on the Discord server was talking about how Pokemon GO / Ingress would actually fit really well with the God Machine stuff...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Rekindled: The Oroboroi Chronicles.</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">The official reboot of <b>Dragon: The Embers</b>.</span></span></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","name":"RockstarRaccoon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10120_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}